ALFA architecture with a 5-star GNCAP safety rating, it features 90-degree opening doors, 7-inch Harman infotainment, voice-assisted sunroof, and twin-cylinder CNG option.', '{"Top-tier 5-star GNCAP safety rating in micro-SUV segment","High seating position gives command over traffic","Suspension absorbs potholes comfortably","iCNG dual-cylinder version retains functional boot space"}', '{"Engine can feel vocal under hard acceleration","AMT gearshifts are relaxed rather than sporty"}', 187) ON CONFLICT (id) DO UPDATE SET starting_price = EXCLUDED.starting_price, images = EXCLUDED.images, colors = EXCLUDED.colors;
