atform features ventilated 1st & 2nd row captain seats, 12.3-inch Harman touchscreen, 10-speaker JBL audio, Level 2 ADAS, gesture tailgate, and 5-star GNCAP & BNCAP safety ratings.', '{"First-class 2nd-row ventilated captain seating option","5-star BNCAP safety with 7 airbags and Level 2 ADAS","Powerful 2.0L Kryotec Diesel engine (170 PS) with smooth 6-speed AT"}', '{"No petrol powertrain option available","Infotainment screen occasionally boot-up delayed"}', 205) ON CONFLICT (id) DO UPDATE SET starting_price = EXCLUDED.starting_price, images = EXCLUDED.images, colors = EXCLUDED.colors;
