zing Bronze"}', 4.7, 2100, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, 4, 220, 2184, 150, 320, 4, 'The Mahindra Thar is India''s most iconic 4x4 off-roader, boasting 226mm ground clearance, 650mm water wading ability, Mechanical Locking Differential, removable convertible/hardtop roof choices, mStallion Turbo Petrol and mHawk Diesel engines.', '{"Unbeatable off-road capability and 4x4 ruggedness","Head-turning road presence and timeless design","Strong mHawk Diesel and mStallion Turbo Petrol engines","Choice of RWD, 4x4, Hardtop, and Convertible options"}', '{"Bumpy highway ride on uneven surfaces","Limited rear luggage boot space with seats up"}', 226) ON CONFLICT (id) DO UPDATE SET starting_price = EXCLUDED.starting_price, images = EXCLUDED.images, colors = EXCLUDED.colors;
