olten Red","DSilver"}', 4.8, 3400, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, 9, 460, 2184, 130, 300, 4, 'The Mahindra Scorpio Classic brings the legendary stance of the original Scorpio powered by the lightweight mHawk 2.2L Diesel engine, cable shift 6-speed manual transmission, 9-inch touchscreen, and 7 & 9-seater seating configurations.', '{"Unmatched traditional SUV road presence and high seating stance","Lightweight 2.2L mHawk diesel engine offers punchy low-end pulling power","Available in 7-seater and 9-seater cabin layouts"}', '{"Lacks modern ADAS or sunroof options found in Scorpio N","Manual transmission only with no automatic choice"}', 209) ON CONFLICT (id) DO UPDATE SET starting_price = EXCLUDED.starting_price, images = EXCLUDED.images, colors = EXCLUDED.colors;
