"Silver Metallic","Sparkling Black"}', 4.8, 3800, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, 7, 296, 2755, 201, 500, 5, 'The Toyota Fortuner is India''s most trusted full-size 7-seater SUV, offering legendary reliability, 204 PS 2.8L Turbo Diesel power delivering 500 Nm torque, tough ladder-frame chassis, high-low ratio 4x4, and outstanding resale value.', '{"Legendary bulletproof Toyota engine reliability and durability","Commanding 204 PS / 500 Nm diesel torque with high resale value","Exceptional off-road 4x4 prowess with 225mm ground clearance"}', '{"Ride quality is stiff over sharp urban road undulations","Infotainment screen size is modest compared to price tag"}', 225) ON CONFLICT (id) DO UPDATE SET starting_price = EXCLUDED.starting_price, images = EXCLUDED.images, colors = EXCLUDED.colors;
